+$$ dist = \frac{i_{step}}{N_{samples} - 1} $$
+$$ p = o + d \times dist $$
+where $i_{step}$ ranges from $0$ to $N_{samples}-1$, and $o, d$ are the transformed ray origin and direction vectors.
+
